"To ensure you can continue using SideStore, \nthe app must be reinstalled now using the new certificate. Otherwise, you will be unable to refresh or open SideStore once the old certificate expires." = "为了能继续使用,现在需要用新证书重新安装一次。\n否则旧证书过期后,你将无法刷新或打开西瓜IPA助手。";
"Unable to Launch SideStore" = "无法启动西瓜IPA助手";
"You can reset the pairing file when you cannot sideload apps or enable JIT. You need to restart SideStore." = "当无法侧载应用或启用 JIT 时,可以重置配对文件。重置后需要重启西瓜IPA助手。";
